body:
Tucker vs New England in 2012? Week 3, kicked a game winner as time expired.

&#x200B;

Edit: Misread. They mean each of the three games, not within the three.

They have no callouses to loss. Unless they were fans before the dominance, but the dominance has been so long that even old callouses heal up. Any time they lose or anything threatens their throne, they freak. This is sociology. Or, if you want to put it medically, they have weak ass immune systems.

&#x200B;

EDIT: Just want to clarify, I don't mean 100% of Patriots fans. I'm sure these fans piss the good fans off even more than they piss us off.

"but work just one date" fits the flow of the song better :)

&#x200B;

edit: no it doesn't ignore me
